cff-version: 1.2.0
title: NeuroFoil — ML-Accelerated Aerodynamic Design and CFD Verification Platform
message: >-
  If you use this software or dataset, please cite it using this metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: BLACKNIGHT
    name-suffix: cloud12
repository-code: "https://github.com/BLACKNIGHT-cloud12/NeuroFoil-Core"
abstract: >-
  NeuroFoil couples an automated 2D RANS OpenFOAM pipeline (k-omega SST,
  structured C-grids, y+ ~ 1) with neural surrogates for forces and surface
  pressure distributions, split-conformal uncertainty quantification,
  Mahalanobis out-of-distribution guardrails, aero-structural wingbox
  mechanics, and constrained MDAO design optimization.
keywords:
  - aerodynamics
  - CFD
  - surrogate modeling
  - uncertainty quantification
  - conformal prediction
  - OpenFOAM
  - machine learning
license: Apache-2.0
